{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00536","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 姑洗徵 · 刘晃","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 姑洗徵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君出震，有事郊禋。\n斋戒既肃，馨香毕陈。\n乐和礼备，候暖风春。\n恭惟降福，实赖明神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘晃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}